      "diverges_at": "N02", "trigger": "you let the agent swing his crane over the trench to get the nephew out", "trigger_kind": "act", "way": 2,
      "ending": { "title": "The Cracked Lid", "summary": "The find leaves on the train in the sponsor's crate with its lid cracked, and the student rides with it, to see her name on its case in the sponsor's museum. The foreman stays on the hill with his men paid and his nephew alive, and does not come to the station.", "answer": "pole_a", "standing": ["the foreman"], "lost": ["the student"], "changed": "the find is the sponsor's, damaged; the village has seen nothing" },
      "why_different": "T1 keeps the find and loses the student; this line loses the find and the student both and keeps the foreman only by his nephew's debt: the other answer, with the dig run by the agent from the second crisis on."
    },
