      "strategy": "Let her lead the agent's crew down the trench to lift it, and answer the council at the station with the day book that shows what the foreman knew.",
      "diverges_at": "N03", "trigger": "you let the student lead the agent's crew down the trench to lift it", "trigger_kind": "act", "way": 2,
      "ending": { "title": "Her Name on the Case", "summary": "The find goes on the train with the student beside it in the goods van, her name to go on its case. The foreman and his men have walked off the hill, the council turns its back on you at the station, and the second burial is left open to the rain.", "answer": "pole_a", "standing": ["the student"], "lost": ["the foreman", "the foreman's mother"], "changed": "the upper burial is destroyed by the rain; the village will not have you back" },
      "why_different": "Seed 1 loses the student and keeps the foreman; this line is the reverse, and the village is lost with him. T1 keeps the find; this does not."
